     3	// localStorage (~5MB cap) and a giant inline CSS `url("data:...")` value choke
     4	// on the result. Instead we keep the raw File/Blob in IndexedDB (which honors
     5	// `unlimitedStorage`) and render it via a short-lived `blob:` object URL.
